{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" = [","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/element"]}],"metadata":{"title":"MaximalCliques.Element","symbolKind":"typealias","roleHeading":"Type Alias","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Element","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"MaximalCliques.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques.swift#L260"},"externalID":"s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V7Elementa","modules":[{"name":"Cliques"}],"role":"symbol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sequence.Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Element"},"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"type":"topic","title":"MaximalCliques","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques"},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"abstract":[],"title":"Vertex","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/vertex","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable"}]},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/Element":{"title":"MaximalCliques.Element","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Element","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/element","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/Element","role":"symbol"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"title":"Cliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","role":"collection"}}}